| LH-01 | `formulas/L_Homme_Luxe_Neroli_Gingembre_Luminous_Silk_DHP2025_V1_30mL_20pct_Development.md` | `verification_runs/20260902-lhomme-lndl-hedonic-flanker-suite-dhp2025-v1/lh01-neroli-gingembre/pipeline.json` | `verification_runs/20260902-lhomme-lndl-hedonic-flanker-suite-dhp2025-v1/lh01-neroli-gingembre/pipeline_analysis.md` | `output/hedonic-flanker-suite/lh01-neroli-gingembre/audit.jsonl` |
