```powershell
git add -- verification_runs/20260902-lhomme-lndl-hedonic-flanker-suite-dhp2025-v1/SUITE_MANIFEST.json verification_runs/20260902-lhomme-lndl-hedonic-flanker-suite-dhp2025-v1/TEST_RECEIPT.md
