```

If Step 1 regenerated a formula and its bundle, stage only those named files together with the receipts and state why their prior diagnostics were stale.

- [ ] **Step 6: Apply the final evidence ceiling**

Declare `READY FOR REPOSITORY INTEGRATION` only if every scoped artifact and persisted diagnostic is manifested, all focused/relevant tests pass, the final diff contains no out-of-scope bytes, source and donor gates pass, there is no unresolved executable-stock blocker, and the applicable repository acceptance rule permits the broader-test result. Otherwise declare `HOLD` and name the exact blocker. In either state, keep all smell, liking, hedonism, luxury, depth, similarity, performance, safety, stability, and release conclusions at `NOT TESTED` until physical evidence exists.

