- Red-flag scan: run `rg -n -i "T[B]D|T[O]DO|PLACEH[O]LDER|FIXM[E]|implement lat[e]r|fill in detai[l]s|add appropriate error handlin[g]|write tests for the abov[e]|similar to tas[k]" docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-02-lhomme-lndl-hedonic-flanker-suite.md`; expected exit code `1` with no matches.
- Interface consistency: every formula path, control path, guide path, bundle slug, test-helper name, donor-signature name, and final manifest path is defined once in the File Map and reused verbatim.
- Historical-byte check: SHA-256 for Target-Native V5, Interiorized V6, rejected V7, Azulene-Juniper V2, and the White Fire signature must equal the Task 1 authority receipt at final verification.
- Worktree check: pre-existing `AGENTS.md` and `.codex/` changes remain outside every commit.
